        "### 1. Data Acquisition and Preprocessing (Simulated)\n",
        "\n",
        "We'll start by simulating a small dataset of audio features and mood labels. In a real-world scenario, these features would be extracted from audio files (e.g., MFCCs, spectral centroids, tempo, energy, etc.)."
      ]
