        "**The Challenge:**\n",
        "\n",
        "Directly mapping complex, rich audio features extracted from real audio files (using libraries like `librosa`) to these 5 hypothetical features is not scientifically straightforward or universally defined. `librosa` provides a vast array of sophisticated audio descriptors such as:\n",
