        "*   **Chroma features:** 12 values representing harmonic content.\n",
        "*   **Spectral features:** Centroid, bandwidth, rolloff, flatness, contrast.\n",
        "*   **Rhythmic features:** Tempo, beat frames.\n",
        "*   **Energy and loudness:** RMS energy.\n",
